   270|    <!-- PAGE 2: OPENING LETTER -->
   271|    <div class="page">
   272|        <div class="section-header">From the Reader</div>
   273|        <h2>Greetings, Alex</h2>
   274|        <p>
   275|            I am your reader at Oriental Destiny, trained in the classical methods passed down through the Longhu Mountain lineage. For generations, these techniques have been used to map the energetic blueprint of a person's life.
   276|        </p>
   277|        <p>
   278|            The chart you hold is not a prediction carved in stone. It is a <span class="emphasis">mirror</span> — a reflection of the energetic conditions present at the moment of your birth. By understanding these patterns, you may better recognize your own nature, avoid unnecessary resistance, and move with the current of your life rather than against it.
   279|        </p>
   280|        <p>
   281|            I have calculated your Four Pillars by hand, corrected your birth time to True Solar Time, and examined the interaction of your Stems and Branches. What follows is my reading of your chart.
   282|        </p>
   283|        
   284|        <div class="master-note">
   285|            <div class="master-note-header">🖋 Reader's Note</div>
   286|            <p>Your Day Master is <span class="red-ink">Ren Water (壬水)</span> — the great river. This is a noble stem: intelligent, far-reaching, and endlessly adaptable. But a river without banks becomes scattered. Your life task is to find the right channel for your vast mental energy.</p>
   287|        </div>
   288|        
   289|        <div class="signature-block">
   290|            <div class="signature-name">Your Longhu Mountain Reader</div>
   291|            <div class="signature-title">Oriental Destiny</div>
   292|        </div>
   293|        
   294|        <div class="cta-banner no-print">
   295|            <h3>Order Your Own Reading</h3>
   296|            <p>Receive a hand-prepared 4,000-word destiny analysis written specifically for you.</p>
