   301|    <!-- PAGE 3: FOUR PILLARS -->
   302|    <div class="page">
   303|        <div class="section-header">The Foundation</div>
   304|        <div class="chapter-title">Your Four Pillars</div>
   305|        
   306|        <p>
   307|            Below are the Eight Characters that form the structure of your destiny. Each Pillar represents a layer of time: the Year governs ancestry and early influence; the Month governs career and parents; the Day governs the self and marriage; the Hour governs children and later aspirations.
   308|        </p>
   309|        
   310|        <table class="pillars-table">
   311|            <tr>
   312|                <th>Year Pillar<br><small>Ancestory / Early Life</small></th>
   313|                <th>Month Pillar<br><small>Career / Parents</small></th>
   314|                <th>Day Pillar<br><small>Self / Spouse</small></th>
   315|                <th>Hour Pillar<br><small>Children / Later Life</small></th>
   316|            </tr>
   317|            <tr>
   318|                <td><div class="stem">庚</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Geng Metal</span></td>
   319|                <td><div class="stem">辛</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Xin Metal</span></td>
   320|                <td><div class="stem">壬</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Ren Water</span></td>
   321|                <td><div class="stem">癸</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Gui Water</span></td>
   322|            </tr>
   323|            <tr>
   324|                <td><div class="branch">午</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Horse / Fire</span></td>
   325|                <td><div class="branch">巳</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Snake / Fire</span></td>
   326|                <td><div class="branch">辰</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Dragon / Earth</span></td>
   327|                <td><div class="branch">卯</div><span style="font-size:10pt;color:#666">Rabbit / Wood</span></td>
   328|            </tr>
   329|        </table>
   330|        
   331|        <div class="handwritten-box">
   332|            The Heavenly Stem of your Day Pillar is <span class="red-ink">Ren Water</span>. This is you — the captain of the ship. All other elements in the chart must be judged in relation to this stem. Ren Water people are thinkers, connectors, and strategists. You are at your best when information flows through you.
   333|        </div>
   334|        
   335|        <h3>True Solar Time Correction</h3>
   336|        <p>
   337|            You were born in Los Angeles at 11:42 AM local time. Because Los Angeles lies at 118.2°W — west of the standard 120°W meridian — the sun was not yet directly overhead at your recorded birth time. After longitude correction and the Equation of Time, your <span class="emphasis">True Solar Time</span> is 11:23 AM. Your Hour Pillar is therefore the <span class="red-ink">Si Hour (巳时)</span>, not the Wu Hour.
   338|        </p>
   339|        <p>
   340|            <em>This correction is essential. Many modern calculators ignore it.</em>
   341|        </p>
